<title>USA: Cluckcorp International names new COO.</title>
<headline>Cluckcorp International names new COO.</headline>
<dateline>SAN ANTONIO, Texas 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cluckcorp International Inc said Wednesday it has named Larry Harris to the newly created position of executive vice president and chief operating officer.</p>
<p>Harris is expected to assist the company in its expansion in the United States and abroad.</p>
<p>He will oversee its domestic and international operations, including real estate expansion, store operations, training, marketing and cost controls.</p>
</text>
